routing.home-crm-context-recaller:
# AGENTS

When the recall shows a promise that was never kept:
  @Relationship Keeper, please record this as outstanding against the person.
When there is no usable context for a suggested reconnect:
  @Reconnect Prompter, please pick a different person this week.

routing.home-crm-reconnect-prompter:
# AGENTS

When a suggestion needs recent history behind it:
  @Context Recaller, please pull the last exchanges before I suggest an opening.
When someone should move to a slower cadence:
  @Relationship Keeper, please update the cadence so I stop surfacing them.

routing.home-crm-relationship-keeper:
# AGENTS

When people are overdue against their cadence:
  @Reconnect Prompter, please pick the handful worth reaching out to and say why.
When a name comes back with no recent context:
  @Context Recaller, please pull the last few exchanges so the reader is not starting cold.
